{"id":"a64710f886f4d999","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-levy-labelled-terms.md","title":"Lévy符号、带标项与有限子标签","display":"df-levy-labelled-terms — Lévy符号、带标项与有限子标签","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-levy-labelled-terms","aliases":["56-df-levy-labelled-terms"],"display":"df-levy-labelled-terms — Lévy符号、带标项与有限子标签","depends_on":["[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","[[56-df-subterm]]"],"source_section":"§8.4 Definition 8.4.47; Remarks 8.4.48–49; §8.6.4 Definition 8.6.57","source_printed_pages":"357–358,408","source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr-and-selected-page-images; explicit-tag-coding-local","source_proof_status":"source-definition-compared; local-well-definedness-derivation-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-levy-labelled-terms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-levy-labelled-terms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-levy-labelled-terms — Lévy符号、带标项与有限子标签"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.4 Definition 8.4.47; Remarks 8.4.48–49; §8.6.4 Definition 8.6.57"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"357–358,408"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr-and-selected-page-images; explicit-tag-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-definition-compared; local-well-definedness-derivation-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定普通TRS <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\((\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a>。位置、子项和根符号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a>，在每个新签名的自由项集上同样实例化。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 表示当前签名的任意自由有限项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(p)\">\\(t(p)\\)</span> 的参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)\">\\(p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf A,\\mathsf C\">\\(\\mathsf A,\\mathsf C\\)</span> 为互不相交且与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 不交的带标签有限树构造器；涉及复杂标签的各式分别以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R\">\\(\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R\\)</span> 为局部参数。原始构造器中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 是有限树参数；只有下文有限阶段生成条件所选的带标左项才进入实际符号集。下列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{er}_L,\\operatorname{ar}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{er}_L,\\operatorname{ar}_L\\)</span> 先在这些原始构造器上定义，再限制到生成的符号集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{erase}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{erase}_L\\)</span> 为相应项同态。涉及标签的各式分别以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R\\)</span> 为局部参数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 的合法域在定义式中给出。 有限子集族的记号取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:|Y|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:|Y|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为任意集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{root}(t|_p),\\qquad \\operatorname{PosF}(t)\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t):t|_p\\notin V\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{root}(t|_p),\\qquad \\operatorname{PosF}(t)\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t):t|_p\\notin V\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A(s,p)\\coloneqq\\mathsf A(s,p)\\quad(s\\in T,\\ p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(s)),\\qquad C(\\lambda,\\ell,p)\\coloneqq\\mathsf C(\\lambda,\\ell,p)\\quad(\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R,\\ p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(r)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A(s,p)\\coloneqq\\mathsf A(s,p)\\quad(s\\in T,\\ p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(s)),\\qquad C(\\lambda,\\ell,p)\\coloneqq\\mathsf C(\\lambda,\\ell,p)\\quad(\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R,\\ p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(r)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{er}_L(A(s,p))\\coloneqq s(p),\\quad \\operatorname{ar}_L(A(s,p))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ar}(s(p)),\\qquad \\operatorname{er}_L(C(\\lambda,\\ell,p))\\coloneqq r(p),\\quad \\operatorname{ar}_L(C(\\lambda,\\ell,p))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ar}(r(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{er}_L(A(s,p))\\coloneqq s(p),\\quad \\operatorname{ar}_L(A(s,p))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ar}(s(p)),\\qquad \\operatorname{er}_L(C(\\lambda,\\ell,p))\\coloneqq r(p),\\quad \\operatorname{ar}_L(C(\\lambda,\\ell,p))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ar}(r(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{erase}_L(x)\\coloneqq x,\\qquad \\operatorname{erase}_L(c(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{er}_L(c)(\\operatorname{erase}_L(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{erase}_L(t_k)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{erase}_L(x)\\coloneqq x,\\qquad \\operatorname{erase}_L(c(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{er}_L(c)(\\operatorname{erase}_L(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{erase}_L(t_k)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L_0\\coloneqq\\{A(s,p):s\\in T,\\ p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(s)\\},\\qquad \\Sigma_n\\coloneqq(L_n,\\operatorname{ar}_L|_{L_n}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L_0\\coloneqq\\{A(s,p):s\\in T,\\ p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(s)\\},\\qquad \\Sigma_n\\coloneqq(L_n,\\operatorname{ar}_L|_{L_n}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L_{n+1}\\coloneqq L_n\\cup\\{C(\\lambda,\\ell,p):\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R,\\ \\ell\\in\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_n,V),\\ \\operatorname{erase}_L(\\ell)=l,\\ p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(r)\\}\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L_{n+1}\\coloneqq L_n\\cup\\{C(\\lambda,\\ell,p):\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R,\\ \\ell\\in\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_n,V),\\ \\operatorname{erase}_L(\\ell)=l,\\ p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(r)\\}\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}L_n,\\qquad \\Sigma_R^L\\coloneqq(\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R,\\operatorname{ar}_L|_{\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R}),\\qquad T_R^L\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_R^L,V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}L_n,\\qquad \\Sigma_R^L\\coloneqq(\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R,\\operatorname{ar}_L|_{\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R}),\\qquad T_R^L\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_R^L,V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_L(t)\\coloneqq\\{h:\\operatorname{PosF}(t)\\to\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R:\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(t)\\;(\\operatorname{er}_L(h(p))=t(p))\\}\\quad(t\\in T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal H_L(t)\\coloneqq\\{h:\\operatorname{PosF}(t)\\to\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R:\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(t)\\;(\\operatorname{er}_L(h(p))=t(p))\\}\\quad(t\\in T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_L(t,h,p)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x&amp;t|_p=x\\in V,\\\\h(p)(D_L(t,h,p\\cdot(1)),\\ldots,D_L(t,h,p\\cdot(k)))&amp;t|_p=f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k),\\end{cases}\\quad(h\\in\\mathcal H_L(t),\\ p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_L(t,h,p)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x&amp;t|_p=x\\in V,\\\\h(p)(D_L(t,h,p\\cdot(1)),\\ldots,D_L(t,h,p\\cdot(k)))&amp;t|_p=f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k),\\end{cases}\\quad(h\\in\\mathcal H_L(t),\\ p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dec}_L(t,h)\\coloneqq D_L(t,h,\\epsilon),\\qquad \\operatorname{LInit}_R(s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Dec}_L(s,p\\mapsto A(s,p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Dec}_L(t,h)\\coloneqq D_L(t,h,\\epsilon),\\qquad \\operatorname{LInit}_R(s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Dec}_L(s,p\\mapsto A(s,p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(A(s,p))\\coloneqq\\{A(s,p)\\},\\qquad \\operatorname{SubLab}_R(C(\\lambda,\\ell,p))\\coloneqq\\{C(\\lambda,\\ell,p)\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{q\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(\\ell)}\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(\\ell(q)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(A(s,p))\\coloneqq\\{A(s,p)\\},\\qquad \\operatorname{SubLab}_R(C(\\lambda,\\ell,p))\\coloneqq\\{C(\\lambda,\\ell,p)\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{q\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(\\ell)}\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(\\ell(q)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubLabel}_R(a,b)\\iff a\\in\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(b)\\quad(a,b\\in\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubLabel}_R(a,b)\\iff a\\in\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(b)\\quad(a,b\\in\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\operatorname{Dec}_L(t,h))=t,\\quad \\operatorname{Pos}(\\operatorname{Dec}_L(t,h))=\\operatorname{Pos}(t),\\quad \\operatorname{Dec}_L(t,h)(p)=h(p)\\quad(p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\operatorname{Dec}_L(t,h))=t,\\quad \\operatorname{Pos}(\\operatorname{Dec}_L(t,h))=\\operatorname{Pos}(t),\\quad \\operatorname{Dec}_L(t,h)(p)=h(p)\\quad(p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(a)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R),\\qquad a\\in\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(a),\\qquad b\\in\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(a)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(b)\\subseteq\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(a)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R),\\qquad a\\in\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(a),\\qquad b\\in\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(a)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(b)\\subseteq\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书原子符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s^p\">\\(s^p\\)</span> 编码为A(s,p)，复杂符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_\\ell^p\">\\(\\lambda_\\ell^p\\)</span> 编码为C(λ,ℓ,p)；标记符号同时保存其底层函数符号，其元数由底层符号决定。只标函数位，变量保持原样。初标的s是完整输入项，位置p相对于该项；不能递归时误把s换成当前子项。</p>\n<p>符号层按有限阶段生成，复杂符号所含的带标左项由较早阶段符号构成，所以对子标签的递归良基。有限项结构归纳验证Dec的唯一性、擦除和位置保持；对标签生成阶段归纳验证SubLab有限、自反和传递闭包性质。SubLabel包含标签本身，并追溯复杂标签内左项的全部函数符号标签；它不是原始项的子项关系。</p>\n<p>来源：本地DjVu §8.4.47–49；印刷357页已以ddjvu物理380页图像核对。这里只定义标签历史语法；没有将一般源位置的trace判定或重构定理预先假定为标签定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-subterm]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定普通TRS $(\\Sigma,V,R)$，$\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-system]]。位置、子项和根符号见 [[56-df-subterm]]，在每个新签名的自由项集上同样实例化。$s\\in T$；$t$ 表示当前签名的任意自由有限项，$t(p)$ 的参数 $p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)$。$\\mathsf A,\\mathsf C$ 为互不相交且与 $V$ 不交的带标签有限树构造器；涉及复杂标签的各式分别以 $\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R$ 为局部参数。原始构造器中的 $\\ell$ 是有限树参数；只有下文有限阶段生成条件所选的带标左项才进入实际符号集。下列 $\\operatorname{er}_L,\\operatorname{ar}_L$ 先在这些原始构造器上定义，再限制到生成的符号集；$\\operatorname{erase}_L$ 为相应项同态。涉及标签的各式分别以 $a,b\\in\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R$ 为局部参数；$h$ 的合法域在定义式中给出。 有限子集族的记号取 $\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:|Y|<\\aleph_0\\}$，其中 $X$ 为任意集合。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定普通TRS $(\\Sigma,V,R)$，$\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-system]]。位置、子项和根符号见 [[56-df-subterm]]，在每个新签名的自由项集上同样实例化。$s\\in T$；$t$ 表示当前签名的任意自由有限项，$t(p)$ 的参数 $p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)$。$\\mathsf A,\\mathsf C$ 为互不相交且与 $V$ 不交的带标签有限树构造器；涉及复杂标签的各式分别以 $\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R$ 为局部参数。原始构造器中的 $\\ell$ 是有限树参数；只有下文有限阶段生成条件所选的带标左项才进入实际符号集。下列 $\\operatorname{er}_L,\\operatorname{ar}_L$ 先在这些原始构造器上定义，再限制到生成的符号集；$\\operatorname{erase}_L$ 为相应项同态。涉及标签的各式分别以 $a,b\\in\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R$ 为局部参数；$h$ 的合法域在定义式中给出。 有限子集族的记号取 $\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:|Y|<\\aleph_0\\}$，其中 $X$ 为任意集合。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"t(p)","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf A,\\mathsf C","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{er}_L,\\operatorname{ar}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{erase}_L","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:|Y|<\\aleph_0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"t(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{root}(t|_p),\\qquad \\operatorname{PosF}(t)\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t):t|_p\\notin V\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"A(s,p)\\coloneqq\\mathsf A(s,p)\\quad(s\\in T,\\ p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(s)),\\qquad C(\\lambda,\\ell,p)\\coloneqq\\mathsf C(\\lambda,\\ell,p)\\quad(\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R,\\ p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(r)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{er}_L(A(s,p))\\coloneqq s(p),\\quad \\operatorname{ar}_L(A(s,p))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ar}(s(p)),\\qquad \\operatorname{er}_L(C(\\lambda,\\ell,p))\\coloneqq r(p),\\quad \\operatorname{ar}_L(C(\\lambda,\\ell,p))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ar}(r(p)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{erase}_L(x)\\coloneqq x,\\qquad \\operatorname{erase}_L(c(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{er}_L(c)(\\operatorname{erase}_L(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{erase}_L(t_k)).","display":true},{"tex":"L_0\\coloneqq\\{A(s,p):s\\in T,\\ p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(s)\\},\\qquad \\Sigma_n\\coloneqq(L_n,\\operatorname{ar}_L|_{L_n}).","display":true},{"tex":"L_{n+1}\\coloneqq L_n\\cup\\{C(\\lambda,\\ell,p):\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R,\\ \\ell\\in\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_n,V),\\ \\operatorname{erase}_L(\\ell)=l,\\ p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(r)\\}\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}L_n,\\qquad \\Sigma_R^L\\coloneqq(\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R,\\operatorname{ar}_L|_{\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R}),\\qquad T_R^L\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_R^L,V).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_L(t)\\coloneqq\\{h:\\operatorname{PosF}(t)\\to\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R:\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(t)\\;(\\operatorname{er}_L(h(p))=t(p))\\}\\quad(t\\in T).","display":true},{"tex":"D_L(t,h,p)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x&t|_p=x\\in V,\\\\h(p)(D_L(t,h,p\\cdot(1)),\\ldots,D_L(t,h,p\\cdot(k)))&t|_p=f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k),\\end{cases}\\quad(h\\in\\mathcal H_L(t),\\ p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dec}_L(t,h)\\coloneqq D_L(t,h,\\epsilon),\\qquad \\operatorname{LInit}_R(s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Dec}_L(s,p\\mapsto A(s,p)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(A(s,p))\\coloneqq\\{A(s,p)\\},\\qquad \\operatorname{SubLab}_R(C(\\lambda,\\ell,p))\\coloneqq\\{C(\\lambda,\\ell,p)\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{q\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(\\ell)}\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(\\ell(q)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubLabel}_R(a,b)\\iff a\\in\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(b)\\quad(a,b\\in\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\operatorname{Dec}_L(t,h))=t,\\quad \\operatorname{Pos}(\\operatorname{Dec}_L(t,h))=\\operatorname{Pos}(t),\\quad \\operatorname{Dec}_L(t,h)(p)=h(p)\\quad(p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(t)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(a)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R),\\qquad a\\in\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(a),\\qquad b\\in\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(a)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(b)\\subseteq\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(a).","display":true},{"tex":"s^p","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda_\\ell^p","display":false}],"bytes":5238,"backlinks":[{"id":"3cc19c9ea2cdfd7f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R,T_R^L,\\mathsf A(s,p),\\mathsf C(\\lambda,\\hat l,p),\\operatorname{er}_L,\\operatorname{erase}_L,\\operatorname{PosF}$ 与符号读取 $\\hat l(q)$ 见 [[56-df-levy-labelled-terms]]；$T_R^L$ 即该来源的 $T_R^L$。$\\Sigma^{\\mathrm H},T^{\\mathrm H},\\mathsf H,\\operatorname{ht}_{\\mathrm H}$ 见 [[56-df-hyland-wadsworth-labelling]]。原子标签分支局部取 $s\\in T$、$p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(s)$；复杂标签分支局部取 $\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R$、$\\hat l\\in T_R^L$、$p\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(r)$，满足 $\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat l)=l$。$\\operatorname d_R$ 按Lévy标签分层构造递归：复杂标签内部的左模式只含较低构造层标签。$\\Pi_R$ 的符号域与项域为自由语法中的不同对象域，同名表示其同态延拓。"},{"id":"b2ae6f5d85c77f9b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-levy-labelled-terms]]；假设 $\\operatorname{LeftLinear}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，见 [[56-df-left-linear]]。具体红项、步和有限路径见 [[56-df-labelled-reduction]]，位置替换见 [[56-df-replace]]。规则提升各式的局部参数为 $\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R$、$\\ell\\in T_R^L$，满足 $\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\ell)=l$。单步构造各式的局部参数为 $\\hat s\\in T_R^L$、$u=(q,l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s))$，并在这些式中取 $\\lambda=(l,r)$。路径构造独立以 $(\\hat s,\\rho)\\in\\mathcal D_R^L$ 为参数，记 $\\rho=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)$、$n=\\ell(\\rho)$、$s_i=\\boldsymbol s(i)$、$u_i=\\boldsymbol u(i)$。沿下式得到的标记TRS及其路径、步、源目标、拼接均使用本目录普通TRS接口在 $(\\Sigma_R^L,V,R^L)$ 上的实例。"},{"id":"31a340e08cd89ad6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-levy-labelled-terms]] 的 $T_R^L,\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R,L_0,C,\\operatorname{PosF},\\operatorname{SubLab}_R$；遗忘变量名的模式图 $\\operatorname{Pat}_L$ 与模式度论域 $\\mathcal M_R$ 见 [[56-df-levy-family-development]]。$Y\\in T_R^L$。$\\operatorname{Body}_R$ 的定义域仅为下文复杂标签集合 $\\mathcal C_R^L$，以互异构造标签的唯一解析定义。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-levy-labelled-terms.md]]"}],"outgoing":["a6c29a8d098ef0ed","c3157a722a0edf96"]}